recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the lane's queue is clear of reds and the next two doors both want a word: whether a negative-existence claim about a room we own is worth a reported ratchet, and whether the several-line interleave gets its anchor per insert. The card standing at exactly its bound with eight accounts on one front is the third, and it is not mine to raise.
